🧠 Introduction

LLMs can be used in real-world applications through **APIs (Application Programming Interfaces)**.

👉 APIs allow you to:

✔ Send input → Get AI response
✔ Build apps without training models
✔ Integrate AI into websites & apps

---

🔹 What is an API?

```text id="api_def"
Client → Request → Server (Model) → Response
```

---

# 🌐 Popular LLM APIs

* OpenAI API
* Hugging Face API
* Gemini API (Google)

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🤖 1. OpenAI API

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Overview

The **OpenAI API** provides access to models like **GPT-4**.

---

🔹 Features

✔ High-quality responses
✔ Chat-based interface
✔ Code generation
✔ Multimodal capabilities

---

⚙️ Installation

```bash id="openai_install"
pip install openai
```

---

💻 Example

```python id="openai_example"
from openai import OpenAI

client = OpenAI(api_key="YOUR_API_KEY")

response = client.chat.completions.create(
    model="gpt-4",
    messages=[{"role": "user", "content": "Explain AI in simple terms"}]
)

print(response.choices[0].message.content)
```

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🤗 2. Hugging Face API

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Overview

The **Hugging Face API** provides access to thousands of models from the Hub.

---

🔹 Features

✔ Large model collection
✔ Free & open models
✔ Easy integration
✔ Supports many tasks

---

💻 Example

```python id="hf_example"
import requests

API_URL = "https://api-inference.huggingface.co/models/gpt2"
headers = {"Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_API_KEY"}

data = {"inputs": "AI is the future"}

response = requests.post(API_URL, headers=headers, json=data)

print(response.json())
```

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🤖 3. Gemini API (Google)

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Overview

The **Google Gemini API** provides access to **Gemini** models.

---

🔹 Features

✔ Multimodal AI
✔ Strong reasoning
✔ Integrated with Google services

---

💻 Example

```python id="gemini_example"
import google.generativeai as genai

genai.configure(api_key="YOUR_API_KEY")

model = genai.GenerativeModel("gemini-pro")

response = model.generate_content("Explain machine learning")

print(response.text)
```

---

⚔️ Comparison of APIs

| Feature     | OpenAI     | Hugging Face | Gemini |
| ----------- | ---------- | ------------ | ------ |
| Models      | GPT series | Many models  | Gemini |
| Ease of Use | Easy       | Medium       | Easy   |
| Flexibility | Medium     | High         | Medium |
| Multimodal  | Yes        | Limited      | Yes    |

